      en: ["Established in 1988 in Moroni.", "Part of the CNDRS organization.", "Houses a rare specimen of the Coelacanth fish.", "Focuses on four main scientific and cultural themes.", "Includes a national library and historical archives.", "Preserves artifacts from the Comorian Sultanate era."],
